Z||000007||CoolBlue87GT||06-20-2001||01:17 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by RAREW66:<BR><B>Does anyone have any hard numbers on how many Blue Metallic Fieros were made?<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The numbers quoted earlier are correct for the total of Blue,  Not sure about the break down between GT's, Sport, SE, and Base that were blue.  Here's the stats for the total 87 production<BR>Base:     23,603<BR>SE:        3,875<BR>Experimental   2<BR>Sport:     3,135<BR>GT's      15,968<BR>Canadian:  2,139  ??  not sure why these are split out, and what style<P>Welcome to our club.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CoolBlue87GT.gif"> ||||reg||6
