Z||000031||trigger||06-24-2001||11:30 PM||||There are two blue fieros in Dubuque, Iowa.  There is an 87 SE, and an 87 coupe.  The coupe is an auto/2.5.  It has the one rocker panel ripped up, and it could use paint, but it has potential.  The SE looks really nice, but I've only seen it from the highway.  The SE owner also has a black GT.<P>Fred it's about time we get some more Iowans on here.  Especially from the same club as me.  It's me Anthony Wright.  I have the red 88 coupe/ auto.<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trigger.gif"> ||||reg||1
